'''Safari Manager''' is an [[NPC]] located within the {{Zone|Critter Safari Entrance}} of the {{Zone|Torrhus Canyon}} and the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Purpose ==
The '''Safari Manager''' allows entry to the {{Zone|Critter Safari}} with the use of [[Safari Tickets]]. They also allow the player to exchange Safari Tickets for higher tiers with {{Item|Forest Essence}}.

The {{Attr|Ticket Discount}} [[Attribute]], obtained from syphoning the {{Item|June Bug Shard}}, reduces the {{Item|Forest Essence}} cost of exchanging Safari Tickets by {{Green|1}}-{{Green|10%}}.

